  description="The terms for using rbxeyes: an unofficial Roblox code tracker. Codes are reported by third-party sources, never guaranteed to work, and nothing here is affiliated with Roblox."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms of use</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Short, honest <span class="month">terms</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        rbxeyes is a free, informational fan website. By using it you accept the terms below.
        They mostly say one thing: we report what sources say, and we guarantee nothing.
        Last updated 7 November 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
